__pycache__/
*.pyc
.DS_Store

# Local planning material: briefs, censuses, working notes.
# Read in the session, never committed. Same convention as
# SpatialDDS-demo/directions/.
# `directions/*` and not `directions/`: git does not descend into an excluded
# directory, so a negation inside one can never fire.
directions/*
# One exception, by ruling: the 1.9 candidates file is this repository's own
# output rather than planning material handed to it, and the entries in it --
# deferred lists, design rules, open questions -- record nothing if they are
# not committed. Everything else under directions/ stays ignored.
!directions/spatialdds-1.9-candidates.md
